# Optional cloud storage (Supabase). Copy this file to .env.local and fill both in.
# Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard has them. The anon key is safe to ship in the
# browser: the access rules in supabase/schema.sql are what protect the data.
# On Vercel, add the same two names under Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
